SUMMARY:Greater Portland Young Parent Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Greater Portland Young Parent Fair is an event to empower young parents in connecting with local resources and opportunities while having fun with their families. \nWhat is it?  \nThis event designed for teen/young parents up to 25 years of age. So we make sure it is not only helpful but fun as well. Picture a resource fair with free games\, food\, & prizes. \nWho will be there?  \nWe bring the best resources from Multnomah\, Washington\, & Clackamas counties that are helpful to young families. \nWhy should I go?  \nBesides convenience of all the resources in one location\, the free food\, the amazing prizes\, fun\, and games. Sometimes its nice to be surrounded by people who get you and understand you. \nDo I need to register?  \nWe ask that if you are school or youth organization that is coming as a group\, please go to the event website and click on the school button to register. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/greater-portland-young-parent-fair/
LOCATION:Kingpins Family Entertainment Center\, 3550 SE 92nd Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97266
